% The Daml Script test_trade of the project Daml intro, composing choices: assets, roles and an atomic trade, run on its twin (compose.le, which this program extends).

the target language is: lps.

the knowledge base compose_test_trade extends compose.

the maximum time is 14.

the knowledge base compose_test_trade includes:

% Daml (the script run on a Canton sandbox) ends with these active contracts (their payloads;
% the ids are the ledger's):
%   - asset_holder(eur_bank,alice)
%   - asset_holder(eur_bank,bob)
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,alice)
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,bob)
%   - asset(eur_bank,alice,"EUR",90.0,[])
%   - asset(usd_bank,bob,"USD",100.0,[])
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_daml.pl.
scenario test_trade is:
    % the Daml Script test_trade
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahia with issuer usd_bank and owner alice from 1 to 2.
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahib with issuer usd_bank and owner bob from 2 to 3.
    alice exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahia creating aha from 3 to 4.
    bob exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahib creating ahb from 4 to 5.
    usd_bank exercises issue asset on the asset holder aha with symbol "USD" and quantity 100.0 creating asset_cid from 5 to 6.
    eur_bank creates the asset holder invite eurhia with issuer eur_bank and owner alice from 6 to 7.
    eur_bank creates the asset holder invite eurhib with issuer eur_bank and owner bob from 7 to 8.
    alice exercises accept on the asset holder invite eurhia creating eurha from 8 to 9.
    bob exercises accept on the asset holder invite eurhib creating eurhb from 9 to 10.
    eur_bank exercises issue asset on the asset holder eurhb with symbol "EUR" and quantity 90.0 creating eur_cid from 10 to 11.
    alice exercises set observers on the asset asset_cid with new observers list [bob] creating usd_cid from 11 to 12.
    alice exercises preapprove transfer on the asset holder eurha with asset issuer eur_bank, asset owner bob, asset symbol "EUR", asset quantity 90.0 and asset observers list [] creating eurta_cid from 12 to 13.

